Untrusted applications could bypass Background Activity Launch (BAL) restrictions by entering Picture-in-Picture (PiP) mode and launching an activity through their SDK Sandbox or Private Compute Core (PCC).

This commit updates BackgroundActivityStartController to use hasActiveVisibleNotPinnedWindow() in SDK Sandbox and PCC visibility checks.

TAG=agy
CONV=d05c04fd-f15d-4691-82bb-7a004945e342

Bug: 527036109
Test: atest WmTests:BackgroundActivityStartControllerTests
Flag: EXEMPT BUGFIX
Cherrypick-From: https://googleplex-android-review.googlesource.com/q/commit:27cab264853b4387fc60fea13a0e3c904aae4008
